  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v2.0.0 - Dialect-aware atomic claim (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED / READPAST / OUTPUT) so multiple publisher instances no longer double-publish, and dead-lettered messages are excluded from polling. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
